  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YSXHWf5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1022\" height=\"104\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/titanium\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dependency-titanium-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/266515.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Buuz135mods?color=E04E14&labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/buuz135\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DONATE-PATREON-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/357597633566605313?color=E04E14&labelColor=2D2D2D&label=JOIN DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工业前置</strong>（Industrial Foregoing）是一款允许你自动化 Minecraft 中大多数功能的模组。它拥有适用于各种场景的机器！</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>生物</strong>和<strong>动物</strong>养殖</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>植物</strong>种植</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一套<strong>无限工具</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>大型</strong>物品/流体存储以及物品/流体运输机</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>电力</strong>生成</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附魔</strong>分类与制作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多内容...</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xtfdUxC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"590\" height=\"63\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要开始使用工业前置，你需要使用树液提取器收集乳胶并将其放置在原木前方，然后使用乳胶处理单元配合水和电力来制作橡胶块。阅读手册以获取更多信息。</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Mvwn2ZQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1308\" height=\"660\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">材质由 CyanideX 和 Unity 团队提供&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://crafttweaker.readthedocs.io/en/latest/#Mods/Industrial_Foregoing/IndustrialForegoing/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker 支持</a></span></p>",
